# An odd job (data/jobs.json, game/jobs.ts): the taqueria's first gig on 2026-11-14 is a veggie burrito
# to Tash in Clarion Alley, 80 s once picked up. Read off the board by the menu (mission job ...), the
# order is in your hands at once (you stand at the counter), Tash's order line is said; carried to her,
# the gig is done as a job from the taqueria's board, her thanks said, the clock never ran out.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 teleport 168.10 -313.81 -2.13
cmd 1 mission job taqueria 2026-11-14 0
cmd 60 teleport -26.00 -393.00 2.05
run 200
expect event missionStart{mission=job-taqueria-2026-11-14-0,kind=job} within 2..2
expect event talk{character=tash,line=job-deliver-tash-order,bark=true} within 2..2
expect event missionItem{mission=job-taqueria-2026-11-14-0} within 2..5
expect event missionDone{mission=job-taqueria-2026-11-14-0,kind=job,board=taqueria,gig=deliver} within 60..64
expect event talk{character=tash,line=job-deliver-tash-thanks,bark=true} within 60..64
expect no event missionFailed
